    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336008
    m_Localized: UTILITY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336009
    m_Localized: "Build on {0}  -  {1} / {2} free slots  \xB7  CREWS {3}/{4} busy.
      Tap a structure on the planet to use it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336010
    m_Localized: Nothing here yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336011
    m_Localized: BUILT - tap it on the planet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336012
    m_Localized: Nothing to harvest on this planet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336013
    m_Localized: PLACE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336014
    m_Localized: 1. Build
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336015
    m_Localized: Open Build on the bottom dock and place a Lumber Camp, then a Refinery
      and a Warehouse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336016
    m_Localized: 2. Storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336017
    m_Localized: Your starter backpack has only 9 slots. Build a Warehouse early
      to store extra resources and drag stacks between grids.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336018
    m_Localized: 3. Gather
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336019
    m_Localized: Tap a Lumber Camp, Mine or Drill on the planet to start its mini-game
      and collect resources.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336020
    m_Localized: 4. Refine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336021
    m_Localized: Tap the Refinery to turn raw resources into fuel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336022
    m_Localized: 5. Defend
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336023
    m_Localized: Tap the Alarm and spend fuel to call a wave. More fuel means a longer
      fight and bigger rewards. Gunners and Lasers defend automatically.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336024
    m_Localized: 6. Travel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336025
    m_Localized: Open Map on the bottom dock and spend fuel to visit new planets.
      Your bases stay where you built them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336026
    m_Localized: 7. Upgrade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336027
    m_Localized: Open Command on the bottom dock to manage your bases and unlock
      upgrades, including more backpack space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336028
    m_Localized: FRONTIER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336029
    m_Localized: Build bases across the stars. Gather, refine, travel, and defend
      your worlds from alien waves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336030
    m_Localized: +{0} {1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
