    m_Localized: '{0:N0} PTS   {1} KILLS   x{2}   {3:P0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336045
    m_Localized: GUARDIAN  /  PHASE {0}  /  {1:P0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336046
    m_Localized: BOMB  {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336047
    m_Localized: OVERDRIVE  {0:0.0}s
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336048
    m_Localized: SHIELD RECHARGING  {0:0.0}s
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336049
    m_Localized: 'Drag anywhere to steer. Auto-fire is on.

      Dodge the warning
      shapes. Tap BOMB to clear danger.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336050
    m_Localized: GUARDIAN APPROACHING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336051
    m_Localized: BOMB READY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336052
    m_Localized: OVERDRIVE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336053
    m_Localized: SHIELD BROKEN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336054
    m_Localized: WAVE CLEAR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336055
    m_Localized: RUN PAUSED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336056
    m_Localized: Your route is frozen. Finishing early completes the trip without
      loot or a fuel refund.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336057
    m_Localized: FINISH TRIP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336058
    m_Localized: HULL LOST
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336059
    m_Localized: Revive with half hull and 3 seconds of protection. Each revive reduces
      your grade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336060
    m_Localized: No revives remain. You can still finish the trip, without loot or
      a fuel refund.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336061
    m_Localized: "REVIVE \xB7 FREE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336062
    m_Localized: "REVIVE \xB7 VIEW OFFER"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336063
    m_Localized: "WAITING FOR OFFER\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336064
    m_Localized: GRADE {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336065
    m_Localized: TRIP COMPLETE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336066
    m_Localized: "{0} kills  \xB7  best combo x{1}\n{2} hits  \xB7  {3} revives"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336067
    m_Localized: Clean run!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336068
    m_Localized: "+{0} fuel refunded  \xB7  +{1} XP"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336069
    m_Localized: 'You reached your destination.

      No loot or fuel refund for
      an unfinished run.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336070
    m_Localized: CONTINUE TO DESTINATION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336071
    m_Localized: Build a Lumber Camp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336072
    m_Localized: Gather your first wood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336073
    m_Localized: Build a Warehouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336074
    m_Localized: Craft your first recipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336075
    m_Localized: Clear an alien wave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336076
    m_Localized: Land on a new world
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336077
    m_Localized: Open BUILD > GATHER and place a Lumber Camp on this resource-rich
      home world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336078
    m_Localized: Tap the Lumber Camp and complete its wood mini-game. Better runs
      fill your pack faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336079
    m_Localized: Your backpack is small by design. Store extra resources in a Warehouse
      before expanding your haul.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336080
    m_Localized: Build a Refinery, tap it, and craft a recipe from gathered materials.
      Each recipe is recorded in the Atlas.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336081
    m_Localized: Build an Alarm if needed, tap it, and call a wave when you are ready.
      Defend your base; planets cannot be attacked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336082
    m_Localized: Open the map, choose a reachable world, and spend fuel to land there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336083
    m_Localized: Skip first-session objectives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336084
    m_Localized: '{0} / {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336085
    m_Localized: Your frontier is open
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336086
    m_Localized: You have built, gathered, crafted, defended, and traveled. Follow
      the Atlas and grow outward at your own pace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
