  - m_Id: 1995530313
    m_Localized: Controls gameplay analytics, rewarded ads, and online account, leaderboard
      and cloud-save features. Choices save locally and online services stay opt-in.
      Online services require legal, audience and account-deletion setup. Cloud copies
      are compared and moved only when you choose; no progress is uploaded automatically.
